**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
**/coverage
.git
.github
# Design documents are not build inputs, except docs/api/, which the backend build
# copies onto the classpath (see Dockerfile and backend/pom.xml). Anything new under
# docs/api/ is allowed through automatically; do not narrow this to single files.
docs/**
!docs/api/**
*.md
zap-out
reports
